# Steady-state capture with no central connected, taken after the image had
# already been running for ~30 s (so the boot banner is not in this window).
# ANSI escape sequences stripped.
#
# What it shows:
#   - the offline sampling cadence is exactly 30 s: 00:00:31, 00:01:01, 00:01:31
#   - with no SHT31 wired, the sensor read fails and the battery ADC channel
#     had never been configured. That second line is the bug described in the
#     README: env_sensor_init() returned early on the missing sensor, so
#     adc_channel_setup_dt() was never reached. Both are fixed now.
#
